
---

### 📄 .gitignore

Create this file at the root of your solution (same level as the `.sln` file). This is a **comprehensive** .NET + MAUI specific ignore file.

```gitignore
# Ignore standard .NET build outputs
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.vspscc
*.vssscc
*.sln.docstates
*.sln.ide
.vs/
.vscode/

# Ignore Rider IDE files
.idea/
*.sln.iml

# NuGet packages
packages/
*.nupkg
project.lock.json
project.assets.json
.nuget/

# User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log
*.cache
*.pidb
*.psess
*.vsp
*.psess
*.vspx
*.sap
*.sdf
*.dbmdl
*.dbproj.schemaview
*.jfm
*.pfx
*.publishsettings
orleans.codegen.cs

# MAUI / Mobile specific
# Android
*.apk
*.aab
*.dex
*.class
*.keystore
*.jks
*.key
*.crt
*.pem
*.der
*.csr
platforms/android/local.properties
platforms/android/*.iml
platforms/android/.gradle/
platforms/android/build/
platforms/android/bin/
platforms/android/gen/
platforms/android/obj/

# iOS / Mac
*.app
*.dSYM
*.ipa
*.xcarchive
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
*.p12
*.cer
*.plist
*.entitlements
platforms/ios/*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/
platforms/ios/*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
platforms/ios/Pods/
platforms/ios/build/
platforms/ios/*.framework/
platforms/ios/*.xcworkspace/
platforms/ios/*.xcconfig.user
platforms/ios/*.xcconfig.local

# Windows
*.appx
*.appxbundle
*.msix
*.msixbundle
*.cer
*.pfx
*.thmx
platforms/windows/AppPackages/
platforms/windows/Binaries/
platforms/windows/obj/
platforms/windows/bin/

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Linux
*~
.directory
*.pid
*.lock

# Logs and Diagnostics
logs/
*.log
*.etl
*.trace
*.diagsession

# Test results
TestResults/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
*.coveragejson

# Publish artifacts
*.publish/
publish/
*.deploy
*.pubxml.user

# Environment / Secrets
*.secrets
.env
*.local.*
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Production.json